<main>
  <section class="opening wrap-wide">
    <figure class="hero">
      <img src="/assets/images/stage.jpg" width="1800" height="1201" alt="흰 무대 바닥 위를 검은 옷의 배우와 붉은 재킷의 배우가 몸을 기울여 내달리는 장면">
      <figcaption>성북동비둘기 〈Medea on Media〉, 2017. 사진 옥상훈.</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <div class="opening-text">
      <p class="role">Critic · Dramaturg</p>
      <h1>극장 다니는 사람.<br>좋은 글은 좋은 사람이 쓸 수 있다고 믿는다.</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section wrap-wide" id="writing">
    <div class="side">
      <h2>Writing</h2>
      <div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="분류">
        <button class="chip" type="button" data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">전체</button>
        <button class="chip" type="button" data-filter="criticism" aria-pressed="false">비평</button>
        <button class="chip" type="button" data-filter="programme" aria-pressed="false">프로그램 글</button>
        <button class="chip" type="button" data-filter="academic" aria-pressed="false">논문</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="main">
      <ul class="list">
{%- for item in collections.writing %}
        <li class="item" data-cat="{{ item.data.category }}">
          <p class="meta"><span>{{ item.date | year }}</span><span>{{ item.data.category | catLabel }}</span>{% if item.data.source %}<span>{{ item.data.source }}</span>{% endif %}</p>
          <h3>{% if item.data.hasPage %}<a href="{{ item.url }}">{{ item.data.title }}</a>{% elif item.data.link %}<a href="{{ item.data.link }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">{{ item.data.title }}<span class="ext" aria-label="외부 링크"> ↗</span></a>{% else %}{{ item.data.title }}{% endif %}</h3>
          {% if item.data.work %}<p class="sub">{{ item.data.work }}</p>{% endif %}
        </li>
{%- endfor %}
      </ul>
      <p class="after" data-only="all"><button class="text-btn" type="button" id="show-all">{{ collections.writing.length }}편 모두 보기</button></p>
      <p class="after" data-only="criticism" hidden><a class="text-btn" href="https://saicriticism.com/?s=%EB%8B%A8%ED%8F%89+%EB%B0%95%ED%9A%A8%EA%B2%BD" target="_blank" rel="noopener">단평 모아보기 ↗</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>

